  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;: Suman is brilliant&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>~</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>P</mi></math> : Suman is not brilliant<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;= Suman is rich&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>~</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> : Suman is not rich&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;: Suman is honest&nbsp;</p><p><math><mo>~</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>R</mi></math> : Suman is not honest&nbsp;</p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#10231;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>&#10231;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
